msgid "WpPopPop uses a native two-stage soft trash lifecycle. Trashing a campaign moves it to the Trash view and deactivates it on the frontend. Trashed campaigns can be restored with a single click. Permanent deletion is reserved for administrators and removes all linked submission records."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin-help.php:62
msgid "Quick & Bulk Actions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin-help.php:63
msgid "Hover over any row to use Quick Edit (for changing title and status inline), or Duplicate (to clone a campaign). Use the checkbox column on the left to apply bulk actions (Move to Trash, Publish, Draft, Duplicate) across multiple campaigns at once."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin-help.php:73
msgid "Canvas & Viewports"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-admin-help.php:74
